OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies following single-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has died following a
OL,7,Fsingle-vehicle collision in County
OL,8,FDown.
OL,10,FPolice received a report of the crash,
OL,11,Finvolving a Polaris Ranger, on the Old
OL,12,FMill Road near Banbridge at
OL,13,Fapproximately 05:50 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended the scene
OL,16,Fbut the driver of the car was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,19,FThe Old Mill Road, which was closed for
OL,20,Fa time, has now fully reopened.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
